<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.African Nov trade surplus 378.2 million rand.</title>
<headline>S.African Nov trade surplus 378.2 million rand.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa recorded a trade surplus of 378.20 million rand in November from a 3.902 billion rand surplus in October, latest South African Revenue Service figures show.  </p>
<p>(Data in billions of rand - rounded)</p>
<p>			Nov '96	     Oct '96	    Nov '95</p>
<p>Exports	     11.40		 14.90		 8.44</p>
<p>Imports	     11.03		 11.00		 7.58</p>
<p>Balance		0.38		  3.90		 0.86</p>
<p>			Jan-Nov '96	 Jan-Nov '95</p>
<p>Exports	    115.60		 93.29</p>
<p>Imports	    107.01		 90.28</p>
<p>Balance		8.54		  3.01</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom (+27 11 482-1003)  </p>
<p>This data covers the total foreign trade statistics of the common customs area of South Africa, Botswana, Lesotho, Namibia and Swaziland.</p>
